	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_t01r0101_mama_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あれ……？▼
ごめんなさい▼
いやね　おきゃくさんを
じぶんの　こどもと　まちがうなんて▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-17T03:41:43" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あれ……？▼
ごめんなさい▼
いやね　お客さんを
自分の　子供と　間違うなんて▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-17T04:10:20" />
