	<TextRow
		Label="msg_t01r0101_mama_09d"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>こんどは　こどもを　さがしに
あたしが　たびに　でようかな？▼
ああ　でも　かえってきたときに
るすだと　それは　ざんねんよね</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-06T03:06:25" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>今度は　こどもを　探しに
あたしが　旅に　でようかな？▼
ああ　でも　帰ってきたときに
留守だと　それは　残念よね</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-06T03:06:09" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
